{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xMeeuEgHn31795409476.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>由陳展鵬主持、甄敏芳及林智樂擔任助理主持的TVB全新台慶綜藝問答遊戲節目《弊傢伙！有嘢唔見咗！》，日前（22日）邀得《警是個大佬》一眾演員擔任錄影嘉賓，包括羅子溢、王敏奕、賴慰玲、張馳豪、邱梓謙、鄧智堅、陳若思及廖家爵。</p><p><p><img alt=\"3db0cc4a-c55e-4370-a760-d30e8ccde633.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iYASTzxVvB1795409430.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9e151793-964f-4471-a3dc-5c8dc8da6430.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GKO7Hi9SD71795409437.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f8710eb5-1d96-4349-96ec-913816a5f639.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JBUwziClL91795409453.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>節目每集請來不同嘉賓，考驗他們在限時內憑記憶準確猜出畫面中被抹走的內容，題目範疇橫跨電視、音樂、電影、生活常識、世界知識、地理及歷史等不同領域。《警是個大佬》八位演員當日除了大玩刺激好玩的問答遊戲外，亦順道為即將推出的新劇落力宣傳造勢。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.307616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:52:42.389849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:05.946552+00:00","content_hash":"d57536360c8f29203e560cf763f8b892bb30d76bc69141d68e52d9d9c5704bf0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.307616+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}